  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-based violence discrimination caused by gender inequality, prevention of women&apos;s participation in decision-making processes and gender-based vulnerability of women constitute the basis of the problem for our project.  The most important factor that reproduces this problem again and again is that women and girls also support the continuation of the problem. The capacity of women to develop their identities and demand their rights on the basis of gender equality will increase and strengthen when they can define themselves outside of the mainstream sexist cultural perception.</narrative>
  </description>
